OL,3,GNEWSARam-raiders steal cash machine
OL,4,Afrom petrol station
OL,5,
OL,6,FRam-raiders have torn a cash machine
OL,7,Ffrom a rural petrol station, making it
OL,8,Fthe third incident of its kind in
OL,9,FCambridgeshire in a week.
OL,11,FDebris was left strewn over the garage
OL,12,Fforecourt in Littleport, near Ely,
OL,13,Fafter a construction vehicle smashed a
OL,14,Fhuge hole into the side of the
OL,15,Fbuilding.
OL,17,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,18,Fcalled at 05:00 GMT on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
